with \code{decay = theta} and \code{normalise = FALSE}.

\strong{Weibull CDF.} Robyn converts \code{scale} to periods as
\code{round(quantile(1:n, scale))}, where \code{n} is the length of the series it
adstocks, and uses a kernel of \code{n} lags whose first weight is 1. That is
\code{\link[=adstock_weibull]{adstock_weibull()}} with \code{type = "cdf"}, \code{max_lag = n}, the rounded scale
